    "notes": {
        "53573c9b-acdf-4290-afd6-336910de2c39": {
            "x": 64,
            "y": 656,
            "width": 672,
            "height": 224,
            "content": "## Test data\n\nThe flow creates its own template (Make API Call → POST /public/v1/templates from a public PDF URL), so a fresh workspace works. The **Wait (1m)** gives PandaDoc time to process the uploaded PDF before the template is used — do not remove it. The template has no roles, so the recipient is added without a role. Cleanup deletes the document and the template."
        }
    }
